flowchart TB
    accTitle: Who sees document 412
    accDescr: The archive account paperless owns the file invoice [P412].pdf and sees document 412. It shares the file read-only with jamie, who sees document 412 as well. It shares the file with alex with write permission, so alex could have named it so and sees no document. sam has a file of sam's own named Copy [P412].pdf; it isn't a file of the archive account, so sam sees no document.

    subgraph owner ["paperless, the archive account"]
        own["… invoice [P412].pdf"]
    end
    subgraph reader ["jamie"]
        shared["… invoice [P412].pdf<br>shared read-only"]
    end
    subgraph writer ["alex"]
        writable["… invoice [P412].pdf<br>shared with write permission"]
    end
    subgraph other ["sam"]
        copy["Copy [P412].pdf<br>a file of sam's own"]
    end
    seen1(["✓ document 412"])
    seen2(["✓ document 412"])
    unseen(["✗ no document"])
    unwritten(["✗ no document"])

    own -- "share" --> shared
    own -- "share" --> writable
    writable --> unwritten
    own --> seen1
    shared --> seen2
    seen2 ~~~ copy
    copy --> unseen

    classDef yes fill:#16a34a2e,stroke:#16a34a,stroke-width:2px
    classDef no fill:#dc26262e,stroke:#dc2626,stroke-width:2px
    class seen1,seen2 yes
